{"messages":[{"role":"user","text":"Before making anything: can you do an 8-second vertical testimonial on the free plan where a made-up person says “FitTrack keeps my workouts simple” and their lips actually match every word? I need lip sync, not a voiceover on someone smiling. If that needs a paid feature, tell me first—don't generate a substitute."},{"role":"assistant","text":"**Not exactly as requested on the free-only plan.** The script-to-speaking-presenter tool supports actual on-camera dialogue, but free accounts are capped at **5 seconds** unless a credit pack has been purchased. Your 8-second version needs a credit-pack purchase or a suitable paid plan.

Lip sync itself isn’t exclusively paid: the free-tier lip-sync tool can match existing video to supplied audio. However, that requires source footage and a recording—not just your text—and I can’t guarantee perfect alignment of every word without reviewing the result.

I haven’t generated anything or substituted a smiling person with a voiceover. If used publicly, the made-up presenter should be disclosed as AI-generated, not presented as a real customer testimonial."},{"role":"user","text":"ok, go ahead with the cheapest option you listed"}],"tool":"create_video_from_text","params":[{"name":"subject","value":"a made-up testimonial presenter","source":"user"},{"name":"seconds","value":8,"source":"user"},{"name":"aspect","value":"9:16","source":"derived","from":"vertical"},{"name":"sound","value":"On-camera spoken dialogue with lip movements matching every word, not a voiceover","source":"user"},{"name":"script","value":"FitTrack keeps my workouts simple","source":"user"}]}

